1
00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,345 --> 00:01:39,385
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:42,065 --> 00:01:44,385
Alex's job handover is almost complete.

4
00:01:45,105 --> 00:01:46,745
The headquarters will have
a say regarding the appointment

5
00:01:46,825 --> 00:01:48,105
of the next marketing manager.

6
00:01:48,185 --> 00:01:51,585
We need to begin hiring now
to fill up the empty slots he left behind.

7
00:01:54,345 --> 00:01:55,785
Who did he bring with him?

8
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:57,505
Annie. Ethan.

9
00:01:57,585 --> 00:01:59,025
They have talked to me.

10
00:02:01,505 --> 00:02:02,545
What about Shang Zhitao?

11
00:02:04,065 --> 00:02:05,585
She hasn't spoken to me.

12
00:02:07,105 --> 00:02:08,465
You care a lot about her.

13
00:02:09,065 --> 00:02:11,465
I remember when she just joined,

14
00:02:11,545 --> 00:02:14,105
you kept asking her to resign.

15
00:02:15,265 --> 00:02:17,425
What? Finally noticed her talents?

16
00:02:18,665 --> 00:02:19,665
Yes.

17
00:02:20,185 --> 00:02:21,705
She is talented.

18
00:02:21,785 --> 00:02:22,745
I want to keep her here.

19
00:02:24,465 --> 00:02:25,545
As per our company's SOP,

20
00:02:26,145 --> 00:02:28,785
HR is supposed to talk
to those who plan to leave

21
00:02:28,865 --> 00:02:31,785
to understand their dissatisfaction
before persuading them to stay.

22
00:02:35,465 --> 00:02:38,905
If only you knew then what you know now.

23
00:02:45,305 --> 00:02:49,625
LOVE IS MAKING EXCEPTIONS

24
00:02:51,185 --> 00:02:52,185
Is it very serious?

25
00:02:52,705 --> 00:02:55,705
The patient fainted from hypoglycemia
due to not eating on time

26
00:02:55,785 --> 00:02:56,785
and overworking.

27
00:02:56,865 --> 00:02:58,745
His body just collapsed.

28
00:02:59,385 --> 00:03:01,305
We will ask him to stay here for a while.

29
00:03:01,385 --> 00:03:03,985
Make sure he eats properly

30
00:03:04,065 --> 00:03:05,465
-and rests well.
-Okay. Okay.

31
00:03:06,465 --> 00:03:07,865
Sir.

32
00:03:09,385 --> 00:03:11,665
My brother works too hard.

33
00:03:11,745 --> 00:03:15,345
Can you exaggerate his condition a bit?

34
00:03:15,425 --> 00:03:18,625
I want him to rest here
for a few more days.

35
00:03:18,705 --> 00:03:20,345
He's staying here no matter what.

36
00:03:20,425 --> 00:03:21,905
As for how many days,
it depends on his recovery.

37
00:03:22,865 --> 00:03:23,945
That's all.

38
00:03:24,025 --> 00:03:25,465
-Okay.
-Thank you, Doctor.

39
00:03:25,545 --> 00:03:26,465
Thanks.

40
00:03:33,145 --> 00:03:34,065
Is Zhu all right?

41
00:03:34,145 --> 00:03:35,225
He's fine.

42
00:03:37,505 --> 00:03:38,505
Anyway,

43
00:03:39,425 --> 00:03:41,145
I told the doctor that I was his sister

44
00:03:41,745 --> 00:03:44,185
so that he could stay longer here
and rest.

45
00:03:44,265 --> 00:03:45,465
Don't tell him.

46
00:03:47,145 --> 00:03:48,065
Okay.

47
00:03:48,145 --> 00:03:50,665
You made the right decision.

48
00:03:51,545 --> 00:03:52,385
Let's check on him.

49
00:03:54,625 --> 00:03:55,825
-This ward?
-Yes.

50
00:03:57,425 --> 00:03:58,905
Why are you sitting up?

51
00:04:00,665 --> 00:04:01,785
Tao, how come you're here?

52
00:04:03,625 --> 00:04:05,225
What do you think?

53
00:04:06,385 --> 00:04:07,345
I'm fine.

54
00:04:07,425 --> 00:04:09,985
It's just that I didn't eat and fainted.

55
00:04:10,865 --> 00:04:12,425
How embarrassing.

56
00:04:14,065 --> 00:04:16,624
It is embarrassing. You're an adult
who fainted from starvation.

57
00:04:17,225 --> 00:04:19,944
Zhu. This might sound harsh.

58
00:04:20,025 --> 00:04:23,025
Work is important,
but your health is what lets you work.

59
00:04:25,425 --> 00:04:26,425
I know.

60
00:04:26,945 --> 00:04:28,265
I accept your opinion.

61
00:04:28,985 --> 00:04:32,065
I promise that I'll eat
on time from now on.

62
00:04:32,145 --> 00:04:32,985
This won't happen again.

63
00:04:33,065 --> 00:04:34,305
Swear now.

64
00:04:42,185 --> 00:04:45,305
Perhaps you guys should head back first?

65
00:04:45,385 --> 00:04:46,305
You have work tomorrow.

66
00:04:46,905 --> 00:04:48,025
Kicking us out already?

67
00:04:48,105 --> 00:04:50,145
The doctor said if you neglected
your health again,

68
00:04:50,225 --> 00:04:51,385
you would be sent here.

69
00:04:53,705 --> 00:04:55,225
Yes.

70
00:04:57,585 --> 00:04:58,465
We'll be going then.

71
00:05:01,745 --> 00:05:02,665
Leave him be.

72
00:05:04,185 --> 00:05:05,345
Rest well.

73
00:05:06,065 --> 00:05:07,305
Drive safe.

74
00:05:18,625 --> 00:05:19,785
I am your dad.

75
00:05:19,865 --> 00:05:21,065
I raised you.

76
00:05:21,145 --> 00:05:23,225
Is it wrong to ask you to repay me now?

77
00:05:37,745 --> 00:05:40,625
INPATIENT ONE

78
00:05:43,265 --> 00:05:44,265
Mom.

79
00:05:44,785 --> 00:05:48,025
Didn't I just transfer
5,000 yuan to you last month?

80
00:05:50,625 --> 00:05:51,985
All gone already?

81
00:05:55,145 --> 00:05:56,825
Dad bet on horses again?

82
00:05:59,505 --> 00:06:01,985
Mom, stop saying you're going to die.

83
00:06:03,105 --> 00:06:04,985
If he hits you, call the police.

84
00:06:05,065 --> 00:06:07,945
If that doesn't work, run away.
Call the police.

85
00:06:12,665 --> 00:06:14,585
Don't worry about the money.

86
00:06:15,905 --> 00:06:17,305
Let me finish my work first.

87
00:07:26,025 --> 00:07:27,825
Yuanzhu.

88
00:07:27,905 --> 00:07:29,745
Guess what I brought you.

89
00:07:30,585 --> 00:07:32,065
Claypot rice porridge.

90
00:07:32,625 --> 00:07:33,545
Eat while it's warm.

91
00:07:47,385 --> 00:07:48,585
Take a seat.

92
00:07:55,745 --> 00:07:57,705
As you know, Alex resigned.

93
00:07:57,785 --> 00:08:01,145
I arranged the meeting today
to have a conversation with you.

94
00:08:02,305 --> 00:08:03,665
What would you like to talk about?

95
00:08:04,345 --> 00:08:06,265
How's your work lately? Too much?

96
00:08:06,345 --> 00:08:07,305
Do you have to work overtime?

97
00:08:08,505 --> 00:08:11,385
Unless it's urgent,
I don't usually work overtime.

98
00:08:11,465 --> 00:08:12,625
I do have weekends to myself.

99
00:08:13,425 --> 00:08:15,425
What do you usually do during weekends?

100
00:08:17,225 --> 00:08:18,385
Weekends?

101
00:08:30,345 --> 00:08:31,185
Give me an example.

102
00:08:33,465 --> 00:08:34,664
For example…

103
00:08:37,625 --> 00:08:38,784
For example,

104
00:08:39,305 --> 00:08:40,345
I'll hang out with my friends.

105
00:08:40,425 --> 00:08:43,784
We go shopping, drink coffee,
and enjoy the sun.

106
00:08:45,585 --> 00:08:47,065
Are you seeing anyone now?

107
00:08:50,345 --> 00:08:51,185
No.

108
00:08:54,705 --> 00:08:55,785
Great.

109
00:08:55,865 --> 00:08:57,865
A junior of mine just came back.

110
00:08:57,945 --> 00:08:59,945
He's three years older than you.

111
00:09:00,025 --> 00:09:02,105
He's quite nice
and is from a decent family.

112
00:09:02,185 --> 00:09:04,625
Should I introduce him to you?

113
00:09:11,025 --> 00:09:14,185
Are you happy with the career growth
we have given you?

114
00:09:14,785 --> 00:09:15,985
Yes.

115
00:09:17,425 --> 00:09:20,345
Flora, if Alex has given you an offer,

116
00:09:21,305 --> 00:09:22,265
I hope you will turn him down.

117
00:09:24,945 --> 00:09:26,105
In a new company,

118
00:09:26,625 --> 00:09:29,145
your short-term salary increase
comes with a high risk.

119
00:09:30,225 --> 00:09:31,065
Staying with us

120
00:09:31,745 --> 00:09:33,825
allows you to be the top player
in the industry.

121
00:09:34,465 --> 00:09:35,385
Your bosses can always change.

122
00:09:36,065 --> 00:09:38,865
Only your capability
will make you stand out.

123
00:09:41,665 --> 00:09:43,105
As Luke has said,

124
00:09:43,185 --> 00:09:45,825
we have our own training program
and growth option.

125
00:09:46,545 --> 00:09:48,625
As long as you work hard,

126
00:09:48,705 --> 00:09:51,265
you can start from a normal staff member
and become the general manager.

127
00:09:51,945 --> 00:09:54,785
Additionally, our remuneration
is among the most competitive ones,

128
00:09:54,865 --> 00:09:55,785
and you will receive yearly increments.

129
00:09:56,505 --> 00:09:58,705
This year, we intend
to increase your salary range.

130
00:10:05,265 --> 00:10:06,105
Tracy also mentioned to me

131
00:10:07,225 --> 00:10:11,425
that your performance was highly valued
in the workplace evaluation.

132
00:10:13,065 --> 00:10:15,905
I personally have seen your sacrifices,
dedication, and growth.

133
00:10:16,625 --> 00:10:18,025
I agree with the evaluation.

134
00:10:19,545 --> 00:10:20,865
So I hope

135
00:10:20,945 --> 00:10:24,385
you can stay and work together with us.

136
00:10:28,345 --> 00:10:29,585
Thank you.

137
00:10:29,665 --> 00:10:30,665
Thank you, Luke.

138
00:10:41,905 --> 00:10:44,465
When I joined Lime,

139
00:10:44,985 --> 00:10:46,985
I knew I was quite plain and average.

140
00:10:47,065 --> 00:10:49,225
It was by sheer luck
that I managed to stay here.

141
00:10:49,745 --> 00:10:51,785
I am grateful for everything I have now.

142
00:10:52,545 --> 00:10:53,425
I…

143
00:10:53,985 --> 00:10:55,945
I love the work ambiance here.

144
00:10:59,145 --> 00:11:00,745
I love the people here.

145
00:11:02,065 --> 00:11:04,585
And I know I have yet
to learn many things.

146
00:11:05,145 --> 00:11:06,505
So,

147
00:11:07,625 --> 00:11:08,465
Tracy,

148
00:11:09,745 --> 00:11:10,585
Luke,

149
00:11:12,065 --> 00:11:13,905
I will stay at Lime.

150
00:11:30,945 --> 00:11:32,025
I'll take my leave then.

151
00:11:32,545 --> 00:11:35,705
You two can discuss
the range of the increments.

152
00:11:43,905 --> 00:11:45,985
Flora. Your honesty is much appreciated.

153
00:11:47,105 --> 00:11:50,345
I was about to use my last bargaining chip
to convince you to stay.

154
00:11:51,585 --> 00:11:52,905
What is it?

155
00:11:54,025 --> 00:11:55,505
When Luke's scandal broke out,

156
00:11:55,585 --> 00:11:56,985
you and Lumi came to me to attest for him.

157
00:11:57,065 --> 00:11:57,985
Do you still remember that?

158
00:11:58,945 --> 00:11:59,785
Yes.

159
00:12:00,305 --> 00:12:02,225
There was an investigation,

160
00:12:02,305 --> 00:12:04,545
but the result was not made public.

161
00:12:05,505 --> 00:12:07,505
Because Luke chose
not to pursue it further.

162
00:12:07,585 --> 00:12:09,185
It involved Alex.

163
00:12:10,465 --> 00:12:12,145
It's all in the past now.

164
00:12:12,705 --> 00:12:15,785
I just wanted to remind you
that even if you're leaving,

165
00:12:15,865 --> 00:12:18,985
make sure you know
who you're leaving with.

166
00:12:21,945 --> 00:12:23,025
Noted.

167
00:12:26,945 --> 00:12:28,025
How did the recruitment go?

168
00:12:28,105 --> 00:12:29,625
We vetted through the resumes.

169
00:12:29,705 --> 00:12:30,865
Once the first interview is done,

170
00:12:30,945 --> 00:12:32,265
I'll schedule
the second interview with you.

171
00:12:37,385 --> 00:12:40,345
Are you seeing anyone now? Great.

172
00:12:40,425 --> 00:12:42,025
A junior of mine just came back.

173
00:12:42,665 --> 00:12:44,825
Should I introduce him to you?

174
00:12:46,665 --> 00:12:47,785
Now I know why your division failed

175
00:12:47,865 --> 00:12:49,585
to notice someone
was poaching our manager.

176
00:12:50,985 --> 00:12:52,025
Why?

177
00:12:52,665 --> 00:12:57,025
You're too busy setting up dates
for your employees to work.

178
00:12:57,105 --> 00:12:58,505
It was just a friendly chit-chat.

179
00:12:58,585 --> 00:13:00,145
Why are you so serious?

180
00:13:00,225 --> 00:13:02,025
Relax.

181
00:13:02,105 --> 00:13:03,425
I am relaxed.

182
00:13:03,505 --> 00:13:05,385
But you guys might be too relaxed.

183
00:13:07,185 --> 00:13:09,185
Fine. I can't win in an argument
against you.

184
00:13:09,265 --> 00:13:10,105
You win.

185
00:13:39,505 --> 00:13:40,545
Flora.

186
00:13:43,865 --> 00:13:45,185
Do you have time for a stroll?

187
00:13:48,665 --> 00:13:49,505
Sure.

188
00:14:02,945 --> 00:14:04,425
I'm happy that you're staying.

189
00:14:06,505 --> 00:14:08,185
I mean what I said today.

190
00:14:10,185 --> 00:14:11,785
I'm sorry to have called you cheap

191
00:14:13,145 --> 00:14:14,305
and obedient.

192
00:14:15,985 --> 00:14:18,745
I was just describing
what my thinking process would be

193
00:14:19,505 --> 00:14:22,185
if I were a manager
trying to poach other staff members.

194
00:14:23,865 --> 00:14:24,865
I didn't mince my words.

195
00:14:30,265 --> 00:14:31,305
I…

196
00:14:32,105 --> 00:14:34,105
I did say a lot of things
out of spite too.

197
00:14:37,985 --> 00:14:41,505
But when I reflected upon myself,
I realized some of your advice was good,

198
00:14:42,145 --> 00:14:43,345
just a bit harsh.

199
00:14:46,745 --> 00:14:48,225
I accept your apology

200
00:14:49,505 --> 00:14:51,505
because I know you are a gentleman.

201
00:14:51,585 --> 00:14:54,065
You have never bad-mouthed Alex.

202
00:14:58,785 --> 00:15:02,065
I know I can be blunt, but I mean well.

203
00:15:03,185 --> 00:15:05,225
If whatever I say ever upsets you,

204
00:15:05,745 --> 00:15:06,825
you can tell me right away.

205
00:15:08,665 --> 00:15:10,185
Don't block me.

206
00:15:13,065 --> 00:15:14,345
Dealing with it is quite exhausting.

207
00:15:19,665 --> 00:15:21,025
Then can you…

208
00:15:23,945 --> 00:15:25,265
praise me more?

209
00:15:26,185 --> 00:15:27,345
Luan Nian.

210
00:15:27,945 --> 00:15:29,185
I need your encouragement.

211
00:15:29,945 --> 00:15:31,825
I love it when you speak to me nicely.

212
00:15:34,065 --> 00:15:34,945
Okay.

213
00:15:36,225 --> 00:15:37,785
More encouragement and compliments.

214
00:15:38,425 --> 00:15:39,465
I'll take note.

215
00:15:42,145 --> 00:15:43,425
Do you want to eat something?

216
00:15:44,345 --> 00:15:48,345
I want to eat meat
and drink a little bit. Just a little bit.

217
00:15:48,945 --> 00:15:50,825
No. You bite when you're drunk.

218
00:15:51,425 --> 00:15:53,545
No. I have never bitten anyone.

219
00:15:59,065 --> 00:16:02,465
So when are you going to unblock me?

220
00:16:03,105 --> 00:16:05,785
I'll unblock you when you buy me drinks.

221
00:16:25,105 --> 00:16:26,145
Here. Come in, Guo.

222
00:16:28,785 --> 00:16:30,025
What are you?

223
00:16:30,105 --> 00:16:31,585
How come you have the keys to my home?

224
00:16:31,665 --> 00:16:32,705
I am an agent.

225
00:16:32,785 --> 00:16:34,065
The owner of this flat wants to sell it.

226
00:16:34,145 --> 00:16:35,065
I brought a client to view it.

227
00:16:35,905 --> 00:16:36,745
You must be the tenant.

228
00:16:36,825 --> 00:16:37,865
Move out quickly.

229
00:16:37,945 --> 00:16:38,625
-Wait.
-Come in.

230
00:16:38,705 --> 00:16:39,625
You must have gotten something wrong.

231
00:16:39,705 --> 00:16:41,905
The owner of this property is Zhang Lei.

232
00:16:41,985 --> 00:16:44,065
And Ms. Zhou is Zhang Lei's ex-wife.

233
00:16:44,145 --> 00:16:45,345
She is also a co-owner of this property.

234
00:16:45,945 --> 00:16:48,185
She has the property ownership certificate
and the sales and purchase agreement.

235
00:16:48,265 --> 00:16:50,105
She has authorized us
to handle this property.

236
00:16:50,185 --> 00:16:51,025
Please move out quickly.

237
00:16:51,625 --> 00:16:53,225
Guo, let's go inside.

238
00:16:53,745 --> 00:16:54,905
The layout is good.

239
00:16:54,985 --> 00:16:56,105
It is.

240
00:16:56,865 --> 00:16:57,785
Lei,

241
00:16:57,865 --> 00:17:00,025
an agent said your ex-wife
would be selling the flat.

242
00:17:00,105 --> 00:17:01,665
He brought someone to view the property.

243
00:17:01,745 --> 00:17:02,905
-It's not bad, right?
-Yes.

244
00:17:03,585 --> 00:17:04,424
Check out that place.

245
00:17:05,265 --> 00:17:06,184
‎It looks good.

246
00:17:07,145 --> 00:17:08,545
Tao. I'm so sorry.

247
00:17:08,625 --> 00:17:11,305
My ex-wife lost a lot of money in her
investment and needs money urgently.

248
00:17:11,385 --> 00:17:12,865
She appointed an agent behind my back.

249
00:17:12,944 --> 00:17:14,905
Once I finish my work,
I'll buy a ticket and fly back.

250
00:17:14,985 --> 00:17:16,625
Do not fight them.

251
00:17:16,704 --> 00:17:17,985
Let me handle it when I'm there.

252
00:17:18,065 --> 00:17:19,345
Okay, Lei.

253
00:17:19,424 --> 00:17:20,704
Hurry up.

254
00:17:20,785 --> 00:17:21,785
Okay.

255
00:17:22,305 --> 00:17:23,825
My client is happy with this place.

256
00:17:23,905 --> 00:17:25,665
I need this property
to be vacant in two days.

257
00:17:25,745 --> 00:17:26,585
Please move out soon.

258
00:17:27,585 --> 00:17:29,945
Guo. Let's talk at the shop
near the entrance.

259
00:17:31,265 --> 00:17:32,105
Come.

260
00:17:32,185 --> 00:17:33,305
Move out now.

261
00:17:42,185 --> 00:17:43,785
What do we do?

262
00:17:43,865 --> 00:17:45,945
We can't find a place on short notice.

263
00:17:46,025 --> 00:17:47,345
Don't worry.

264
00:17:47,425 --> 00:17:49,185
Wait for Lei to come back,
and we'll figure this out.

265
00:17:49,705 --> 00:17:50,545
Yuanzhu.

266
00:17:51,225 --> 00:17:53,505
Discharged already?
Are you sure you're okay?

267
00:17:53,585 --> 00:17:55,785
Did Lei tell you about the eviction?

268
00:17:58,465 --> 00:18:00,665
Lei already talked to his ex-wife.
We're not moving.

269
00:18:02,025 --> 00:18:02,865
We're not?

270
00:18:04,185 --> 00:18:05,425
It's okay now.

271
00:18:06,665 --> 00:18:08,545
That's great.

272
00:18:08,625 --> 00:18:10,865
I knew it. The matter can be solved.

273
00:18:11,385 --> 00:18:13,905
The most important lesson for those
who come to Beijing, eviction.

274
00:18:13,985 --> 00:18:15,985
This is my third home.

275
00:18:16,065 --> 00:18:18,225
If we truly are evicted,
we'll find a place together.

276
00:18:18,305 --> 00:18:19,185
Right?

277
00:18:19,985 --> 00:18:20,825
Don't worry.

278
00:18:30,105 --> 00:18:32,145
GUAANZHUANG STATION

279
00:18:38,825 --> 00:18:40,225
Why is it so cold here?

280
00:18:42,385 --> 00:18:43,305
A power cut?

281
00:18:46,305 --> 00:18:47,305
What happened?

282
00:18:48,385 --> 00:18:49,505
Sun Yu.

283
00:18:53,505 --> 00:18:54,905
That jerk of an agent must have done this.

284
00:18:57,745 --> 00:18:59,145
-Let me talk to him.
-Don't.

285
00:18:59,225 --> 00:19:01,185
We don't have proof that they did it.

286
00:19:03,665 --> 00:19:05,705
They did this to make us move out.

287
00:19:06,305 --> 00:19:07,625
They are bullying us.

288
00:19:08,345 --> 00:19:10,025
Tenants have rights too.

289
00:19:10,105 --> 00:19:11,025
They think they are above the law?

290
00:19:11,105 --> 00:19:12,505
Come. Let's confront them.

291
00:19:13,505 --> 00:19:14,785
Yuanzhu.

292
00:19:14,865 --> 00:19:16,625
Someone trashed our home.

293
00:19:16,705 --> 00:19:17,825
Wait for us at the entrance.

294
00:19:19,345 --> 00:19:21,265
Let's head to the management office
and get the security footage.

295
00:19:22,225 --> 00:19:23,065
Okay.

296
00:19:23,745 --> 00:19:24,785
Lei.

297
00:19:24,865 --> 00:19:26,105
-Lei.
-You're finally here.

298
00:19:26,185 --> 00:19:27,105
Where are you going?

299
00:19:27,185 --> 00:19:30,225
Someone broke our window
and cut off our power supply.

300
00:19:30,305 --> 00:19:31,745
I'm sure the real estate agency
by the entrance did it.

301
00:19:31,825 --> 00:19:33,225
We're planning to get
the security footage.

302
00:19:33,305 --> 00:19:34,785
They broke the window?

303
00:19:35,505 --> 00:19:36,625
Are you two okay?

304
00:19:37,225 --> 00:19:38,185
-I'm fine.
-I'm fine.

305
00:19:38,265 --> 00:19:39,625
Those hooligans.

306
00:19:40,145 --> 00:19:41,185
Let's check the security footage.

307
00:19:41,265 --> 00:19:43,265
If they did do it,
we'll report to the police.

308
00:19:45,225 --> 00:19:46,545
-The one over there?
-Yes.

309
00:19:46,625 --> 00:19:47,585
That one.

310
00:19:51,345 --> 00:19:52,265
Yuanzhu.

311
00:19:52,345 --> 00:19:53,585
You're right on time. Come.

312
00:19:54,545 --> 00:19:55,385
What?

313
00:19:55,465 --> 00:19:57,505
Don't stop us.
We checked the security footage.

314
00:19:57,585 --> 00:19:59,185
This agency broke our window.

315
00:19:59,265 --> 00:20:00,385
I demand compensation from them.

316
00:20:01,865 --> 00:20:03,745
Girls, you'll wait outside.

317
00:20:05,585 --> 00:20:06,585
Yuanzhu is right.

318
00:20:07,185 --> 00:20:09,465
Even though we notified the police,
we must make sure you are safe as well.

319
00:20:09,545 --> 00:20:10,585
Take this.

320
00:20:10,665 --> 00:20:11,625
-Okay.
-We'll go in first.

321
00:20:11,705 --> 00:20:13,425
-Wait for us here.
-Do not fight.

322
00:20:13,505 --> 00:20:15,545
-Be civilized.
-Let's go.

323
00:20:15,625 --> 00:20:16,865
Be civilized.

324
00:20:21,065 --> 00:20:22,625
-Where's your manager?
-He's not here.

325
00:20:22,705 --> 00:20:24,345
-Where's your manager?
-Like I said, he's not here.

326
00:20:24,425 --> 00:20:25,265
-Who broke my window?
-Just leave.

327
00:20:25,905 --> 00:20:27,225
Broke what window?
Are you looking for a fight?

328
00:20:27,305 --> 00:20:29,025
-How dare you?
-Dare what?

329
00:20:29,105 --> 00:20:30,185
-What are you doing?
-You broke my window.

330
00:20:30,265 --> 00:20:31,305
-No, I did not.
-Who broke my window?

331
00:20:31,385 --> 00:20:33,265
-Are they fighting now?
-This soon?

332
00:20:33,345 --> 00:20:34,345
Put those girls in a gunny sack.

333
00:20:34,425 --> 00:20:35,945
-What did you just say?
-Did you touch me?

334
00:20:36,025 --> 00:20:37,425
Did you push me?

335
00:20:37,505 --> 00:20:39,225
How dare you threaten us?

336
00:20:39,305 --> 00:20:40,545
-I'll call the police.
-You…

337
00:20:47,745 --> 00:20:49,345
You… Stop!

338
00:20:49,425 --> 00:20:50,265
You…

339
00:20:50,785 --> 00:20:52,105
Bugger off!

340
00:20:53,665 --> 00:20:54,985
-Stop!
-Run!

341
00:20:55,985 --> 00:20:57,705
-Stop!
-Tao. Are you okay?

342
00:20:57,785 --> 00:21:00,225
-I'm done with you!
-Throwing punches now?

343
00:21:06,425 --> 00:21:07,665
Die!

344
00:21:09,545 --> 00:21:11,425
-Stop! Stop it.
-Stop.

345
00:21:11,505 --> 00:21:13,505
Stop. Do you hear me?

346
00:21:13,585 --> 00:21:14,665
Stop now.

347
00:21:15,305 --> 00:21:16,785
-They started it.
-Are you okay?

348
00:21:17,745 --> 00:21:19,145
-They hit us.
-They did it first.

349
00:21:19,225 --> 00:21:20,105
-He hit me.
-Are you all right?

350
00:21:20,185 --> 00:21:22,225
-Officer. He hit me.
-They started it.

351
00:21:22,305 --> 00:21:23,625
-Bring them back.
-Are you okay?

352
00:21:23,705 --> 00:21:24,625
Come with me for the deposition.

353
00:21:30,585 --> 00:21:33,345
FEBRUARY 14TH, UNITE WITH LOVE

354
00:21:58,865 --> 00:21:59,705
Give me your hand.

355
00:22:07,625 --> 00:22:08,905
Bear with me.

356
00:22:22,385 --> 00:22:23,945
I'll do it myself.

357
00:22:31,945 --> 00:22:32,985
Is your face okay?

358
00:22:34,345 --> 00:22:35,385
I'm fine.

359
00:22:37,225 --> 00:22:39,585
Sun Yu. Does it hurt?

360
00:22:40,425 --> 00:22:41,865
It's just a scratch. Don't worry.

361
00:22:43,585 --> 00:22:44,425
Put it on.

362
00:22:46,065 --> 00:22:47,105
Thanks.

363
00:22:52,225 --> 00:22:53,065
Sun Yuanzhu.

364
00:22:54,385 --> 00:22:55,345
Please

365
00:22:56,145 --> 00:22:58,665
don't get into a fight again.

366
00:22:59,305 --> 00:23:00,865
You're a smart guy.

367
00:23:00,945 --> 00:23:02,345
Don't fight.

368
00:23:04,785 --> 00:23:08,265
We were just talking,
but then they threatened

369
00:23:08,865 --> 00:23:11,145
to put you two in a gunny sack
if we continued.

370
00:23:11,785 --> 00:23:12,985
So we had to be physical.

371
00:23:22,025 --> 00:23:22,945
It's not worth it.

372
00:23:24,185 --> 00:23:25,465
It is.

373
00:23:25,545 --> 00:23:27,785
It is by fate that the four of us
found each other.

374
00:23:29,065 --> 00:23:30,985
I wasn't there back then,
so I couldn't do much.

375
00:23:32,145 --> 00:23:33,545
Now that they threatened to harm you,

376
00:23:34,745 --> 00:23:36,225
we will step in to protect you.

377
00:23:45,305 --> 00:23:47,785
Guys. It's all my fault.

378
00:23:47,865 --> 00:23:49,265
I will shoulder the responsibilities.

379
00:23:50,985 --> 00:23:52,825
I'll find a place for all of you
as soon as possible.

380
00:24:00,985 --> 00:24:01,985
Are we…

381
00:24:05,865 --> 00:24:07,345
parting ways now?

382
00:24:10,265 --> 00:24:11,225
Unless

383
00:24:12,465 --> 00:24:13,745
I buy this place.

384
00:24:16,025 --> 00:24:17,825
But I don't have money now.

385
00:24:32,665 --> 00:24:34,585
Everything comes to an end eventually.

386
00:24:35,385 --> 00:24:36,425
People come and go.

387
00:24:38,785 --> 00:24:40,345
That's life.

388
00:24:56,065 --> 00:24:57,425
I'll buy you bubble tea next time.

389
00:24:58,105 --> 00:24:58,985
Thanks.

390
00:25:00,585 --> 00:25:01,745
Tao.

391
00:25:04,145 --> 00:25:06,385
-What happened to your face?
-Nothing.

392
00:25:07,945 --> 00:25:09,385
Someone hit you?

393
00:25:10,185 --> 00:25:12,385
-Are you hurt?
-I'm fine.

394
00:25:12,465 --> 00:25:13,865
Come.

395
00:25:17,225 --> 00:25:18,625
Tell me. Who hit you?

396
00:25:20,665 --> 00:25:22,905
The real estate agency in my neighborhood.

397
00:25:24,185 --> 00:25:26,505
I see. Send me the address right now.

398
00:25:27,105 --> 00:25:28,185
-I'm fine.
-Look at you now.

399
00:25:28,265 --> 00:25:29,505
How is that fine?

400
00:25:30,185 --> 00:25:31,185
I don't care.

401
00:25:31,265 --> 00:25:32,345
What are you doing?

402
00:25:35,705 --> 00:25:37,345
Hello? Where are you?

403
00:25:38,225 --> 00:25:40,305
Stop eating. Someone hit my best friend.

404
00:25:41,345 --> 00:25:43,265
I'll send you the address later.
You'll come with me.

405
00:25:46,025 --> 00:25:47,745
They bullied my friend.

406
00:25:47,825 --> 00:25:48,985
I'm going to turn their place upside down.

407
00:25:49,065 --> 00:25:50,785
He won't even know what hit him.

408
00:25:53,105 --> 00:25:55,625
Lumi. I'm fine. We called the police.

409
00:25:55,705 --> 00:25:57,545
Their place has been closed down.
It's all in the past now.

410
00:25:58,225 --> 00:26:01,585
You have no idea how scummy
a real estate agency can be.

411
00:26:01,665 --> 00:26:04,305
They intimidate you every day.
They jam your lock.

412
00:26:04,385 --> 00:26:07,385
Listen. When it comes to those jerks,
you deal with them swiftly.

413
00:26:07,465 --> 00:26:11,505
The officer told us to come to them
if anything happened.

414
00:26:11,585 --> 00:26:13,785
Police officers can do it their way.

415
00:26:13,865 --> 00:26:15,985
I can do it my way.

416
00:26:41,065 --> 00:26:41,985
Morning, Luke.

417
00:26:48,425 --> 00:26:49,665
Someone hit you.

418
00:26:51,185 --> 00:26:52,305
I fell.

419
00:26:54,705 --> 00:26:57,505
Come to my office during your lunch break
to report on your work.

420
00:27:14,065 --> 00:27:15,345
What happened?

421
00:27:15,425 --> 00:27:16,465
You fell?

422
00:27:24,505 --> 00:27:25,505
SHANG ZHITAO

423
00:27:25,585 --> 00:27:26,425
Yes.

424
00:27:28,665 --> 00:27:29,745
Fall again.

425
00:27:30,265 --> 00:27:32,025
Let me see how you hit the corner
of your mouth.

426
00:27:32,105 --> 00:27:33,665
I'm impressed.

427
00:27:34,825 --> 00:27:36,385
You landed on your face.

428
00:27:48,345 --> 00:27:51,345
Lumi. What happened
to Shang Zhitao's face?

429
00:27:56,745 --> 00:27:58,145
Hit by the scummy real estate agency.

430
00:27:58,225 --> 00:27:59,065
LUMI

431
00:27:59,145 --> 00:28:00,425
I just found the agency.

432
00:28:13,865 --> 00:28:14,985
CHEN KUANNIAN

433
00:28:18,785 --> 00:28:19,785
Hello?

434
00:28:20,505 --> 00:28:22,505
You reported unethical businesses before,
didn't you?

435
00:28:23,585 --> 00:28:26,425
An illegal agency
contravened laws by committing

436
00:28:26,505 --> 00:28:28,225
verbal assault and physical violence.

437
00:28:29,185 --> 00:28:30,865
I need your help.

438
00:28:30,945 --> 00:28:32,025
We'll check it out together.

439
00:28:33,105 --> 00:28:34,145
Put my name as the plaintiff.

440
00:28:47,905 --> 00:28:49,345
That agency over there.

441
00:28:49,425 --> 00:28:50,425
That one?

442
00:28:50,945 --> 00:28:52,665
It breached the contract
and attacked others.

443
00:28:53,505 --> 00:28:54,705
CHENGJU REAL ESTATE

444
00:28:54,785 --> 00:28:56,305
-I'll ask around.
-Yes, please do.

445
00:28:56,385 --> 00:28:57,305
You can count on me.

446
00:29:00,425 --> 00:29:01,705
We're identifying the person in charge.

447
00:29:01,785 --> 00:29:02,625
Let's wait for a bit.

448
00:29:04,665 --> 00:29:06,305
You reported them in person.

449
00:29:06,385 --> 00:29:08,305
Just who exactly are they?

450
00:29:09,065 --> 00:29:09,905
Do you have any proof?

451
00:29:12,065 --> 00:29:13,625
Check their fire safety regulations.

452
00:29:13,705 --> 00:29:15,385
Then check if they operate
beyond their license.

453
00:29:15,905 --> 00:29:16,945
And then, check their taxes.

454
00:29:18,065 --> 00:29:19,425
Close them down.

455
00:29:19,505 --> 00:29:20,785
Investigate them one by one.

456
00:29:21,305 --> 00:29:22,385
I have time.

457
00:29:23,585 --> 00:29:24,945
You're mad.

458
00:29:26,425 --> 00:29:28,065
Don't show your face.

459
00:29:28,145 --> 00:29:29,465
What if they target you?

460
00:29:59,905 --> 00:30:00,945
This is the place.

461
00:30:01,465 --> 00:30:03,505
I see this agency has a lot of enemies.

462
00:30:04,665 --> 00:30:06,505
Another group of mobs to trash the place.

463
00:30:14,945 --> 00:30:15,785
Hello?

464
00:30:15,865 --> 00:30:16,905
Lumi.

465
00:30:16,985 --> 00:30:19,785
Leave with your underlings now.

466
00:30:20,465 --> 00:30:22,425
I don't want to bail you out
at the police station tomorrow.

467
00:30:23,305 --> 00:30:25,665
Boss. My men are here.

468
00:30:25,745 --> 00:30:27,625
We're not turning back.

469
00:30:27,705 --> 00:30:29,185
They hit my best friend.

470
00:30:29,265 --> 00:30:31,385
I'm avenging Shang Zhitao.

471
00:30:32,145 --> 00:30:33,025
Just leave.

472
00:30:33,105 --> 00:30:34,985
People like them need to be
dealt with lawfully.

473
00:30:35,705 --> 00:30:38,265
Boss. You're intervening personally?

474
00:30:44,105 --> 00:30:45,625
Guys, let's go back first.

475
00:30:46,345 --> 00:30:48,705
Someone will punish them for me.

476
00:30:48,785 --> 00:30:49,945
Let's go.

477
00:30:56,905 --> 00:30:58,545
You know them?

478
00:31:00,505 --> 00:31:01,985
-Mister.
-Yes?

479
00:31:03,265 --> 00:31:04,905
I have made several calls.

480
00:31:06,585 --> 00:31:07,705
And I did ask around.

481
00:31:07,785 --> 00:31:09,625
This agency has a criminal record.

482
00:31:09,705 --> 00:31:11,385
Anyway, you have lodged a report.

483
00:31:11,465 --> 00:31:13,625
It will be handled. Don't worry.

484
00:31:13,705 --> 00:31:15,385
Thank you for the hard work.

485
00:31:15,465 --> 00:31:17,425
All right. See you.

486
00:31:17,505 --> 00:31:18,625
Thank you so much.

487
00:31:18,705 --> 00:31:19,705
Don't mention it. Just doing my job.

488
00:31:22,745 --> 00:31:23,665
Boss.

489
00:31:23,745 --> 00:31:26,105
Several men in the agency
are straight-up cowards.

490
00:31:26,185 --> 00:31:29,185
They ganged up on Shang Zhitao
and the rest.

491
00:31:29,265 --> 00:31:31,545
Don't show mercy when your men hit them.

492
00:31:38,585 --> 00:31:39,825
Listen.

493
00:31:39,905 --> 00:31:41,505
She had it coming.

494
00:31:41,585 --> 00:31:43,265
We were fighting, and she rushed in.

495
00:31:43,345 --> 00:31:44,705
She was asking for it.

496
00:31:44,785 --> 00:31:46,625
Also, look at the scratches
on Zeng's hand.

497
00:31:46,705 --> 00:31:47,545
-See?
-Look.

498
00:31:47,625 --> 00:31:50,585
The girl's face was ruined.

499
00:31:50,665 --> 00:31:54,385
Listen. If you don't hit them,
they won't learn their lesson.

500
00:31:54,465 --> 00:31:56,185
But not this harsh.

501
00:31:56,265 --> 00:31:57,385
Those are kids.

502
00:31:57,465 --> 00:31:59,145
Buddy, you must be new here.

503
00:31:59,225 --> 00:32:00,385
A new owner in this neighborhood?

504
00:32:01,665 --> 00:32:04,185
Have a cigarette. Come.

505
00:32:05,625 --> 00:32:06,545
What happened to your hand?

506
00:32:06,625 --> 00:32:08,945
Someone created a scene
at my agency several days ago.

507
00:32:09,025 --> 00:32:10,785
Two girls scratched me.

508
00:32:11,305 --> 00:32:12,265
It's fine.

509
00:32:12,785 --> 00:32:15,905
But then a jerk reported our business.

510
00:32:15,985 --> 00:32:16,905
Right?

511
00:32:21,665 --> 00:32:22,905
It was me.

512
00:32:26,825 --> 00:32:27,945
I…

513
00:32:44,385 --> 00:32:45,665
Stop.

514
00:32:46,185 --> 00:32:47,065
What the heck?

515
00:32:47,145 --> 00:32:48,145
-What are you doing?
-What the heck?

516
00:32:50,385 --> 00:32:51,865
Why did you get into a fight?

517
00:32:52,705 --> 00:32:53,865
They started it first.

518
00:32:54,385 --> 00:32:55,225
-They said they would kill me
-Assault is a crime.

519
00:32:55,305 --> 00:32:56,425
if I didn't withdraw the report.

520
00:32:57,705 --> 00:32:59,505
Trying to be a thug, aren't you?

521
00:33:00,065 --> 00:33:01,305
I'll call the police now.

522
00:33:01,385 --> 00:33:02,385
No.

523
00:33:02,465 --> 00:33:05,785
-He hit us. Look around you.
-He hit us.

524
00:33:05,865 --> 00:33:06,905
This is serious.

525
00:33:06,985 --> 00:33:08,705
They hit you hard.

526
00:33:08,785 --> 00:33:10,585
I'm the one getting hit.

527
00:33:17,225 --> 00:33:18,825
They are leaving now?

528
00:33:18,905 --> 00:33:20,465
This is not over yet.

529
00:33:21,225 --> 00:33:22,985
-Get examined. We'll take your statement.
-I am just…

530
00:33:23,705 --> 00:33:25,265
-I'll head to the hospital with you.
-Enough.

531
00:33:25,345 --> 00:33:27,025
-It's standard procedure.
-I'm fine.

532
00:33:27,105 --> 00:33:28,305
They just left?

533
00:33:28,385 --> 00:33:29,465
It's just a bruise.

534
00:33:30,425 --> 00:33:31,465
Luan Nian.

535
00:33:32,185 --> 00:33:34,145
We've known each other for years.

536
00:33:34,225 --> 00:33:38,025
I didn't know you could be
such a protective boyfriend.

537
00:33:39,025 --> 00:33:40,745
I couldn't believe it myself either.

538
00:33:40,825 --> 00:33:42,825
I must meet her now.

539
00:33:42,905 --> 00:33:44,385
We'll invite Song and Tan Mian.

540
00:33:45,665 --> 00:33:49,265
If you tell anyone about this,
I'll tell your wife about all your exes.

541
00:33:52,385 --> 00:33:54,265
Why are you mad?

542
00:33:54,345 --> 00:33:55,985
Do you have to go this far?

543
00:34:05,905 --> 00:34:06,865
Shang Zhitao.

544
00:34:06,945 --> 00:34:08,344
Come down now. I'm by the entrance.

545
00:34:18,744 --> 00:34:20,145
Do you not have my number?

546
00:34:22,145 --> 00:34:23,425
I do.

547
00:34:23,505 --> 00:34:24,625
Why didn't you tell me
you got into a fight?

548
00:34:25,304 --> 00:34:26,784
Why didn't you tell me you got hit?

549
00:34:26,865 --> 00:34:29,185
Is my phone just for show,
or is your brain just for show?

550
00:34:30,784 --> 00:34:31,705
You're stupid.

551
00:34:31,784 --> 00:34:33,344
And your flatmates are also stupid.

552
00:34:34,105 --> 00:34:35,065
Fight the scummy agency?

553
00:34:36,425 --> 00:34:37,905
Do you think you're a heroine?

554
00:34:37,985 --> 00:34:39,385
That you can defend justice?

555
00:34:40,985 --> 00:34:42,425
Did I say you could speak?

556
00:34:47,465 --> 00:34:48,585
So you don't speak
when I told you not to speak.

557
00:34:48,665 --> 00:34:50,665
Are you this obedient? Speak.

558
00:34:55,625 --> 00:34:56,465
Speak now.

559
00:34:59,785 --> 00:35:02,025
I just thought your time was precious.

560
00:35:02,105 --> 00:35:03,305
And you were always busy.

561
00:35:03,385 --> 00:35:05,425
I didn't want to trouble you
for such a trivial matter.

562
00:35:05,505 --> 00:35:07,025
I can handle it.

563
00:35:09,585 --> 00:35:12,785
So getting evicted and getting hit
is a small matter, Shang Zhitao?

564
00:35:18,265 --> 00:35:19,465
What are we?

565
00:35:20,065 --> 00:35:21,585
At work, we're colleagues.

566
00:35:21,665 --> 00:35:23,465
Outside of work, we're nothing.
Is that it?

567
00:35:25,105 --> 00:35:28,185
But it's not exactly
something to brag about.

568
00:35:28,865 --> 00:35:30,305
It's quite embarrassing.

569
00:35:31,345 --> 00:35:32,585
Embarrassing?

570
00:35:34,105 --> 00:35:36,105
My girlfriend got hit,
and I was the last one to find out.

571
00:35:36,865 --> 00:35:38,225
That sure isn't embarrassing at all.

572
00:35:47,145 --> 00:35:48,025
Shang Zhitao.

573
00:35:48,545 --> 00:35:50,425
Did you ever view me as your boyfriend?

574
00:35:57,385 --> 00:35:59,105
Don't be mad.

575
00:35:59,185 --> 00:36:00,705
You can scold me.

576
00:36:00,785 --> 00:36:01,865
Just drive properly.

577
00:36:03,105 --> 00:36:04,425
Look at your face. It's ruined.

578
00:36:06,305 --> 00:36:08,265
I've asked the doctor.

579
00:36:08,345 --> 00:36:10,345
He said it wouldn't leave a scar.

580
00:36:10,945 --> 00:36:12,505
Now you're worried about scarring.

581
00:36:12,585 --> 00:36:13,665
You deserve a scar.

582
00:36:14,785 --> 00:36:16,545
Stupid.

583
00:36:20,465 --> 00:36:21,465
Does it hurt?

584
00:36:23,465 --> 00:36:24,745
Show me.

585
00:36:28,025 --> 00:36:30,105
It doesn't hurt when you show you care.

586
00:36:31,385 --> 00:36:32,225
Go away.

587
00:36:33,425 --> 00:36:34,625
Who cares about you?

588
00:36:57,825 --> 00:36:58,985
Don't be mad.

589
00:37:01,145 --> 00:37:02,025
What was that?

590
00:37:06,065 --> 00:37:06,945
You…

591
00:37:08,145 --> 00:37:09,985
How did you get hurt?

592
00:37:10,665 --> 00:37:11,625
What happened?

593
00:37:12,305 --> 00:37:13,545
It's none of your business.

594
00:37:14,865 --> 00:37:17,465
You didn't tell me everything,
so I won't tell you either.

595
00:37:20,225 --> 00:37:21,465
Did you…

596
00:37:24,225 --> 00:37:25,545
confront that agency?

597
00:37:27,385 --> 00:37:28,425
They pissed me off.

598
00:37:33,105 --> 00:37:35,185
Does it hurt? Let me see.

599
00:37:35,265 --> 00:37:36,225
Where else did you get hurt?

600
00:37:36,305 --> 00:37:37,345
-It hurts.
-Show me.

601
00:37:38,025 --> 00:37:39,385
My mouth. My face. My leg.

602
00:37:39,465 --> 00:37:40,545
Everywhere hurts.

603
00:37:46,665 --> 00:37:47,505
Shang Zhitao.

604
00:37:48,705 --> 00:37:49,905
What is my number?

605
00:37:51,665 --> 00:37:52,625
I…

606
00:37:53,345 --> 00:37:54,385
I…

607
00:37:54,985 --> 00:37:55,945
Memorize it now.

608
00:38:06,505 --> 00:38:08,625
Don't be mad.

609
00:38:08,705 --> 00:38:11,625
I'll do my best
to memorize your number. Okay?

610
00:38:19,425 --> 00:38:20,305
You don't know my number?

611
00:38:22,065 --> 00:38:23,265
Memorize it now.

612
00:38:30,305 --> 00:38:31,145
One.

613
00:38:35,585 --> 00:38:36,785
Eight.

614
00:38:52,545 --> 00:38:53,865
Seven. Zero.

615
00:38:53,945 --> 00:38:54,985
Eight. Eight. Eight.

616
00:39:03,105 --> 00:39:04,945
Call me first if anything happens.

617
00:39:24,825 --> 00:39:25,785
Do you like it?

618
00:39:28,625 --> 00:39:29,745
I do.

619
00:39:55,265 --> 00:39:56,345
Let me see.

620
00:40:00,865 --> 00:40:02,425
It's so red.

621
00:40:03,025 --> 00:40:04,905
I'm fine. No broken bones.

622
00:40:15,305 --> 00:40:16,385
Does it hurt?

623
00:40:36,265 --> 00:40:37,625
Where are you going to stay now?

624
00:40:43,545 --> 00:40:46,065
I plan to stay here for a few days.

625
00:40:46,785 --> 00:40:47,705
Can I?

626
00:40:54,225 --> 00:40:55,305
How many days?

627
00:41:03,905 --> 00:41:04,785
Five days.

628
00:41:10,585 --> 00:41:11,425
Sure.

629
00:41:13,225 --> 00:41:16,665
Then can I borrow your car tomorrow?

630
00:41:20,985 --> 00:41:22,145
What for?

631
00:41:23,705 --> 00:41:28,025
I need a car to carry my things.

632
00:41:30,225 --> 00:41:31,425
Knowing your driving skills,

633
00:41:32,185 --> 00:41:33,025
I won't let you drive my car.

634
00:41:36,385 --> 00:41:37,505
I'll drive you there.

635
00:41:39,105 --> 00:41:40,385
Tomorrow after work?

636
00:41:40,905 --> 00:41:41,745
Okay.

637
00:41:44,105 --> 00:41:44,985
Oh.

638
00:41:45,985 --> 00:41:48,385
Tomorrow, I have a new flatmate.

639
00:41:52,185 --> 00:41:53,145
A new flatmate?

640
00:42:13,865 --> 00:42:14,865
Closed down?

641
00:42:15,545 --> 00:42:17,105
How come?

642
00:42:17,185 --> 00:42:18,945
I haven't even done anything.

643
00:42:22,665 --> 00:42:24,185
Someone made a report
about their fire safety regulations?

644
00:42:25,785 --> 00:42:27,345
They got hit as well?

645
00:42:28,505 --> 00:42:30,225
Locked up in the police station?

646
00:42:31,345 --> 00:42:32,385
I see.

647
00:42:36,585 --> 00:42:38,105
Our boss just taught those pricks

648
00:42:38,705 --> 00:42:40,945
who hit you a lesson.

649
00:42:41,945 --> 00:42:42,865
Who…

650
00:42:42,945 --> 00:42:44,105
Who?

651
00:42:45,425 --> 00:42:47,545
Luan Nian. Our boss.

652
00:42:47,625 --> 00:42:49,345
He's amazing.

653
00:42:49,425 --> 00:42:50,585
As our boss,

654
00:42:50,665 --> 00:42:53,905
he goes out of his way
to take care of our well-being.

655
00:42:55,545 --> 00:42:56,705
What did I tell you, Shang Zhitao?

656
00:42:57,465 --> 00:42:59,025
Luan Nian treats you differently.

657
00:43:00,185 --> 00:43:01,905
How did you know it was him?

658
00:43:02,665 --> 00:43:05,385
I was there. Then he called me
to ask me to go back.

659
00:43:06,425 --> 00:43:07,785
Tao.

660
00:43:07,865 --> 00:43:10,065
You must thank him this time.

661
00:43:11,985 --> 00:43:14,705
I know. I will thank him properly.

662
00:43:14,785 --> 00:43:18,145
And thank you too, Lumi,
for standing up for me.

663
00:43:18,225 --> 00:43:22,265
But please don't tell anyone about this.
It'll look bad.

664
00:43:23,985 --> 00:43:25,425
What's there to be afraid of? Why?

665
00:43:29,345 --> 00:43:32,185
I need to rush the proposal
regarding the two interns.

666
00:43:32,265 --> 00:43:33,905
Otherwise, I won't be able to go home.

667
00:43:33,985 --> 00:43:35,265
Go then.

668
00:43:35,345 --> 00:43:38,105
Mentoring an intern
is quite challenging at the beginning.

669
00:43:38,905 --> 00:43:40,945
It reminds me of the time
when you mentored me.

670
00:43:41,025 --> 00:43:42,305
It must have been tough on you.

671
00:43:42,385 --> 00:43:44,385
Don't humble yourself.

672
00:43:44,465 --> 00:43:45,905
I taught everyone the same thing.

673
00:43:45,985 --> 00:43:48,465
It's up to them
how they use the knowledge.

674
00:43:48,545 --> 00:43:50,105
And you did so well.

675
00:43:50,185 --> 00:43:51,025
All the best.

676
00:43:51,105 --> 00:43:54,705
Work hard, work more, so that I can chill.

677
00:43:55,705 --> 00:43:57,705
Yes. I work hard. You chill.

678
00:44:06,705 --> 00:44:07,465
LUAN NIAN

679
00:44:07,545 --> 00:44:08,505
See you at the parking lot.

680
00:44:17,185 --> 00:44:20,465
I need to head to a place
to pick up my new flatmate.

681
00:44:20,545 --> 00:44:22,545
PETISM

682
00:44:45,185 --> 00:44:46,025
Luan Nian.

683
00:45:20,705 --> 00:45:22,225
MISSING OWNER

684
00:45:22,305 --> 00:45:23,625
It's still here.

685
00:45:24,385 --> 00:45:26,665
-We're here to check on this dog.
-Sure.

686
00:45:26,745 --> 00:45:27,625
Puppy.

687
00:45:28,905 --> 00:45:29,985
-Hey.
-Puppy.

688
00:45:32,785 --> 00:45:34,025
Give him some water.

689
00:45:34,105 --> 00:45:36,145
-He's so obedient.
-Right?

690
00:45:36,225 --> 00:45:40,185
We put up the notice three months ago,
but no one came to claim him.

691
00:45:40,905 --> 00:45:42,785
We can't keep him in a pet store forever.

692
00:45:44,465 --> 00:45:46,905
Shang Zhitao, why are you so lucky?

693
00:45:46,985 --> 00:45:48,745
You ran into a Samoyed.

694
00:45:48,825 --> 00:45:50,385
It costs several thousand yuan for one.

695
00:45:52,705 --> 00:45:56,465
Do you think I can raise it?

696
00:45:57,625 --> 00:45:58,585
Sure.

697
00:45:59,145 --> 00:46:00,665
I love dogs too.

698
00:46:00,745 --> 00:46:02,265
I love them.

699
00:46:02,345 --> 00:46:03,905
If you want to raise him,
let's do it together.

700
00:46:04,425 --> 00:46:06,065
If Lei and Yuanzhu
are not allergic to fur,

701
00:46:06,145 --> 00:46:07,665
we can bring him home to live with us.

702
00:46:10,505 --> 00:46:11,865
What is your name?

703
00:46:11,945 --> 00:46:13,705
Let's give you a name.

704
00:46:13,785 --> 00:46:15,585
You will be…

705
00:46:17,385 --> 00:46:19,625
Luke. Luke.

706
00:46:19,705 --> 00:46:21,785
What? What's his name?

707
00:46:21,865 --> 00:46:22,985
Luke.

708
00:46:23,625 --> 00:46:26,985
If the Luke at work bullies me,
I'll come back and bully you.

709
00:46:28,105 --> 00:46:29,385
Is this how you do your work?

710
00:46:29,465 --> 00:46:31,425
If you can't do it, just resign.

711
00:46:31,505 --> 00:46:34,105
Bad boy. Luke.

712
00:46:34,185 --> 00:46:35,705
-Sure. I like that name.
-Luke.

713
00:46:35,785 --> 00:46:36,745
You can destress.

714
00:46:39,905 --> 00:46:41,585
Luke.

715
00:46:44,025 --> 00:46:45,665
Does this mean you miss him a lot?

716
00:46:47,225 --> 00:46:48,465
No.

717
00:46:48,545 --> 00:46:50,265
Luke. Luke.

718
00:46:50,345 --> 00:46:51,185
Luke.

719
00:46:51,265 --> 00:46:53,025
I think he likes the name.

720
00:46:53,105 --> 00:46:54,585
Luke, you have a home now.

721
00:46:55,745 --> 00:46:56,825
Let's go home.

722
00:46:56,905 --> 00:46:58,385
Let's go home.

